fork is not a submission. Unused exploratory edits need not be submitted.
This duty covers changes to this Software, not independently written research
code, data or other work merely used alongside it. Submissions are subject to
section 5. The Licensor may accept, revise or reject a contribution; submission
does not entitle you to a merge or authorize a separate derivative release.

You must preserve origin, copyright and attribution notices. You may not
rebrand or present the Software or a derivative as your own or your institution's
